      "content": "i'm just so tired of everything. like, every single day feels like i'm performing a role for people i don't even like, just so i don't stand out or make things awkward. it's just constant. i feel like i'm on a different wavelength than everyone else and i'm never gonna catch up. it's just exhausting to even exist sometimes.",
